    "detailed_description": "Fast paced archery game! You are trapped on a small island in the sky, delaying your inevitable death by rocks smashing into your head. <br><br>This game is not for the weak! Be prepared for a thorough workout, where you have to duck, weave and move around a lot. You better have an extra headset cover, because the one you have will be sweaty!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Satisfying bow &amp; arrow physics!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Waves of enemies with increasing difficulty.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Several types of enemy types and behaviors, forcing you to adapt and be quick on your feet to complete the later levels</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Steam leaderboards, so you can compete with people from around the world</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> All around great cardio workout!</li></ul>",
